## Software that powers the Ecosystem of Care

Behave Health supports organizations across the full behavioral health continuum — from outpatient
programs to inpatient treatment, recovery residences, and community-based recovery support.

### Outpatient

Scheduling, documentation, billing, and referral follow-up for clinic-based services.

### IOP and PHP

Group programming, attendance, authorizations, utilization review, and per-diem claims.

### Residential

Bed management, census, medication workflows, clinical records, and payer follow-through.

### Withdrawal Management

Structured admissions, safety checks, medication documentation, and step-down planning.

### Recovery Residences

House operations, drug testing, resident accountability, payments, and peer-support records.

### Community Support

Alumni engagement, referrals, care coordination, and ongoing recovery touchpoints.

